    Id: runic
    DisplayName: Runic
    Description: A deeper well of mana. Manaflow is this family's regen affix, Quickcast
      its mana-discount tempo affix, and Wardrune its mana-to-ward affix -- all four
      used to roll together as one bundled Runic modifier; split so each rolls on
      its own like every other affix.
